<overview>
<p>New technology and creative tactical thinking have long featured in FWLM infantry deployment, with varied unit types and specialized formations treated as the norm rather than the exception. Towing crew-served LB 2-X autocannon, these platoons can switch between solid slugs for long-range precision and cluster munitions that scatter across a wider area, providing tactical flexibility rare in field gun formations.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on common production date of LBX autocannon
</notes>

